  tip Back west to Quel'Danil Lodge; rangers and marksmen stay near the lodge, scouts and outrunners on the slopes south of it.
  kill 2692 quest 7841.1
  kill 2691 quest 7841.2
  kill 2694 quest 7841.3
  kill 2693 quest 7841.4

step Jintha'Alor
  when group 7849
  tip Huntsman Malkhor's skull lies on a pile below the Vilebranch ruins, his bones on a pile at the foot of Jintha'Alor. The Vessels of Tainted Blood sit on the lower terraces, and Elder Torntusk is held at the top. The trolls inside are elite: stay with your group and keep to the paths.
  collect 19069 quest 7849.1 @58.6,64.8
  turnin 7845                           -- Elder Torntusk, at the top of Jintha'Alor
  note His next request, going on to the Altar of Zul, is for a group.
  collect 19070 quest 7849.2 @62.1,75.3
  collect 19071 quest 7850.1

