# Route from the Polestar route simulator's Horde consensus (Tauren export),
# visits 49-53, levels 47.6-49.5. Checked by lint, not play-tested on
# Forever yet. Era + known Forever quests only.
#
# Flow: Thorium Point (where the previous guide ends) -> fly Stonard -> the
# bloodmages in the Blasted Lands -> the northern beasts and the eastern
# slopes -> the bloodmages -> Stonard, fly Undercity (training) -> fly
# Tarren Mill -> Gilveradin's camp -> Highvale and Rin'ji -> the Witherbark
# village (Grim Message) -> the Violet Tragan -> the Atal'ai Exile ->
# Revantusk Village (flight path, bind) -> the north coast -> the Vilebranch
# temples -> the central hills -> Skulk Rock -> the Silvermane Howlers ->
# Highvale -> Gilveradin -> Jintha'Alor -> Revantusk -> Aerie Peak -> hearth
# Revantusk Village, where the next guide starts.
#
# Deviations from the export:
# - The Booty Bay stop (visit 49) is dropped: a flight and a zeppelin for
#   one accept, Whiskey Slim's Lost Grog (580), and the optional OOX-17/TN
#   turn-in (648, carried on to the next Booty Bay visit). Since 0.3.7 580
#   is taken on 40-50/01's Booty Bay inn stop instead, its bottles picked up
#   on the north coast here and handed in on 40-50/06's Booty Bay stop.
# - The Swamp of Sorrows return (visit 51) is gone: Threat From the Sea and
#   Continued Threat (1426-1428) are finished in forever/horde/40-50/03-feralas.
# - The Blasted Lands come first, straight from Thorium Point by way of
#   Stonard, then the Undercity on the way to Tarren Mill: no Undercity
#   bind, no hearth back to it, no zeppelin.
# - Hinterlands: Gilveradin, the Highvale records, Rin'ji, the Grim Message,
#   the Violet Tragan and the Atal'ai Exile are done on the way in from
#   Tarren Mill; Elder Torntusk is visited with the rest of Jintha'Alor. The
#   Long Elegant Feathers for Another Message to the Wildhammer (7842) drop
#   from the Razorbeak Skylords in the central hills before the quest is in
#   your log, so it is handed in the moment you take it.
# - A short grind check after the bloodmages (level 48) covers the
#   experience lost with the dropped stops here and in the previous guide.
# - Highvale: the report, the notes and the records nearest first, then
#   Rin'ji. Revantusk Village: round the village from the west side, where
#   you ride in; Gorkas, the flight master at the far east end, last.
#
# Class training: the Undercity for Warriors, Paladins, Rogues, Priests,
# Mages and Warlocks; Hunters, Shamans and Druids trained at the end of the
# previous guide and train next in Orgrimmar and Thunder Bluff in the next
# guide.
#
# Optional: Find and Rescue OOX-09/HL! (485, 836): the beacon is a rare drop.
#
# Accepted here, finished later on the route: Rin'ji's Secret (2782),
# Ripple Delivery (81), Lines of Communication
# (2995), Assisting Arch Druid Runetotem (3784); Grim Message (2932),
# Sprinkle's Secret Ingredient (2641) and Testing the Vessel (3123) leave
# here with their objectives done.
#
# Left out: Tabetha's Task (2861) and Venom Bottles (2933): the export never
# hands them in. Return to
# Fel'Zerul (1444): its turn-in stop in Stonard is dropped from the next
# guide (a zeppelin and a flight for one quest), so it is not taken.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Blasted Lands

step Serpent's Coil: kill these as you meet them
  zone Blasted Lands
  tip The five quests share the same parts: gather them all in one sweep. West of the road the Black Slayer vultures, Starving Snickerfangs, Scorpok Stingers and Deatheye basilisks share the hills.
  tip East of the road the Ashmane boars and Grunters root on the slopes beside the Redstone basilisks. Stay away from the level 52 Helboars further south.
  tip Careful: Scorpok Stingers use Venom Sting; Clack the Reaver adds Knockdown.
  collect 8393 x1 quest 2581.3
  collect 8393 x2 quest 2583.2
  collect 8393 x3 quest 2585.1
  collect 8396 x2 quest 2601.2
  collect 8396 x2 quest 2585.2
  collect 8396 x10 quest 2603.1
  collect 8391 x3 quest 2581.1
  collect 8391 x2 quest 2603.2
  collect 8394 x10 quest 2601.1
  collect 8394 x1 quest 2583.3
  collect 8392 x3 quest 2583.1
  collect 8392 x1 quest 2585.3
  collect 8392 x2 quest 2581.2

